cription":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-10-09T21:43:24Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:33:14Z","closed_at":"2026-10-12T14:33:03Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124341","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124341","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124341.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124341.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-12T14:33:03Z"},"body":"# Summary\n\nCloses #124186\n\nPush constants are written to an encoder buffer slot with `setBytes`, which bypasses the uniform binding cache. If another pipeline had a uniform set bound at that slot, the cache still believed the set was bound, so the next draw with that pipeline skipped the rebind and the shader read push constant bytes instead of its uniform data.\n\nThis PR invalidates the cache entry for a slot whenever it is written outside the cache.\n\n# Background\n\nThe binding cache suppresses redundant `setBuffer`, `setTexture` and `setSamplerState` calls within one encoder. It is keyed by slot index. The push constant slot is allocated per shader, after that shader's own uniform buffers, so two pipelines in the same encoder can place a push constant and a uniform set at the same slot.\n\nWith argument buffers, sets occupy slots `0 .. set_count - 1` and the push constant takes `set_count`, so any two pipelines with a different number of sets collide. Without argument buffers the same happens with individual uniform buffer slots.\n\nExample sequence in one encoder:\n\n| Draw | Pipeline | Uniform sets | Push constant | Cache state after draw |\n| :-- | :-- | :-- | :-- | :-- |\n| 1 | A | slots 0 to 3 | slot 4 | slots 0 to 3 hold A's sets |\n| 2 | B | slots 0 to 2 | slot 3 | slots 0 to 2 hold B's sets, slot 3 still records A's set 3 |\n| 3 | A | slots 0 to 3 | slot 4 | slot 3 matches the cache, rebind skipped, shader reads B's push constant bytes |\n\nDraw 3 renders with corrupt data for set 3. In the linked issue this is the mobile renderer on iOS: the sky shader runs between the opaque and transparent passes, and the transparent pass loses its lighting data.\n\nThe 4.6 driver cleared the whole cache on every pipeline change, which hid the problem. That clear was removed in the 4.7 refactor to avoid rebinding every resource on every pipeline switch, which introduced this bug.\n\n\n| before | after |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| <img alt=\"CleanShot 2026-10-10 at 08 27 00@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/773a2645-02cd-424b-a2e3-13717b772d85\" /> | <img alt=\"CleanShot 2026-10-10 at 08 26 26@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/20a88910-f93f-40f1-b880-0ef048f462ee\" /> |\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":